      "url": "https://science.nasa.gov/exoplanet-catalog/hd-20794-e/",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2fdfc01b43b76597\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHD 20794 e is a super Earth exoplanet that orbits a G-type star. Its mass is 4.77 Earths, it takes 147 days to complete one orbit of its star, and is 0.509 AU from its star. <strong>Its discovery was announced in 2017.</strong>\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2fdfc01b43b76597\">>>",
